5,0,1,talk,Kenji,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to play. I think we should all just be honest and help each other find the werewolf!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Victoria,,"Honesty is a luxury in this game, Kenji. We must be rational and observe how everyone reacts to pressure.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Toshio,,I agree with Victoria. Logic and behavioral patterns will be more reliable than simple trust.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,George,,"Let's not be too cynical. Experience tells me that a calm, steady approach usually reveals the truth.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"This is like a big puzzle! @Kenji, do you think you can tell when someone is lying? I bet I can!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"I don't know, Sakura! I usually believe people. But I'll try my best to be a detective!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Sakura, your enthusiasm is noted. But remember, the most energetic people are often the best at hiding things.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Toshio,,We should decide on a strategy. Should we prioritize finding the Seer or identifying the Werewolf first?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,George,,"Finding the Seer is risky. If the Werewolf knows who they are, they'll be gone by tomorrow night.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
