17,0,3,talk,Toshio,,Exactly. I will be watching for any shifts in tone or logic as the days progress.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,George,,I'll keep an eye on the overall atmosphere. Stability is key to avoiding a wrong execution.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
